  "content": "<p>« <a href=\"../../../pages/biochemistry/chemiosmotic-principle-photosynthesis/index.html\">Previous</a> | <a href=\"../../../pages/molecular-biology/index.html\">Next</a> »</p>\n\n    <h3 id=\"session-overview\">Session Overview</h3>\n\n<p>For this exam, you will need to know the properties of amino acids, nucleic acids, and phospholipids, as well as bonds, polarity, respiration, and photosynthesis.</p>\n\n    <h3 id=\"check-yourself\">Check Yourself</h3>\n\n\n    <h4 id=\"exam-and-solutions\">Exam and Solutions</h4>\n\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../../../resources/mit7_01scf11_exam1/index.html\">Exam (PDF)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../../../resources/mit7_01scf11_exam1_sol/index.html\">Solutions (PDF)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>« <a href=\"../../../pages/biochemistry/chemiosmotic-principle-photosynthesis/index.html\">Previous</a> | <a href=\"../../../pages/molecular-biology/index.html\">Next</a> »</p>\n",
